{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977104956,"sessionID":"ses_1ccbc1452ffeszWjsWacrU366B","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_nJLILRV8HRtfXxfQW2gMYgig","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Note: I added the requested myenteric neuron terms and validated the ontology with ROBOT convert and ELK reasoning.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+## Summary\n+\n+Added 14 new CL terms for myenteric neuron types requested in issue #3584, using new `CL_99xxxxx` identifiers:\n+\n+- `CL_9900001` dogiel type II neuron\n+- `CL_9900002` intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900003` interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900004` secretomotor/vasodilator neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900005` intestinofugal neuron\n+- `CL_9900006` ascending interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900007` descending interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900008` stubby Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900009` spiny Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900010` dogiel type II neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900011` calretinin-positive intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900012` calretinin-negative intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900013` cholinergic neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900014` nitrergic neuron of myenteric plexus\n+\n+## Rationale And Modeling Notes\n+\n+- Added definitions and synonym xrefs from the PMIDs supplied in the issue.\n+- Added `term_tracker_item` annotations via `IAO_0000233` pointing to issue #3584.\n+- Added `terms:date` timestamps and `terms:creator \"GitHub Copilot\"` for all new terms.\n+- Used `RO_0002100` for myenteric plexus soma location, matching existing CL location patterns.\n+- Used logical definitions only where they were safe and consistent, such as myenteric sensory/interneuron groupings and cholinergic/nitrergic grouping classes.\n+- Did not make `interneuron of myenteric plexus` a subclass of `CL:0000099` because that existing class is constrained to the CNS (`part_of some UBERON:0001017`), which made the enteric/myenteric terms unsatisfiable under ELK. The new term is instead modeled under `enteric neuron` with myenteric soma location.\n+- Added an axon target restriction for intestinofugal neuron using a union of the listed prevertebral sympathetic ganglia targets.\n+- Did not add calretinin protein-expression logical axioms because the issue explicitly flagged this as needing a PRO term lookup/import decision.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- Checked that requested labels were not already present in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Checked requested parent terms and existing myenteric soma location patterns.\n+- Attempted to fetch cited full texts with `aurelian fulltext`, but `aurelian` was not installed in this environment.\n+- Validated syntax with `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-check.owl`.\n+- Validated satisfiability with `robot reason -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --reasoner ELK -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-reasoned.owl`.\n+- Checked whitespace with `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Note: I added the requested myenteric neuron terms and validated the ontology with ROBOT convert and ELK reasoning.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+Added 14 new CL terms for myenteric neuron types requested in issue #3584, using new `CL_99xxxxx` identifiers:\n+\n+- `CL_9900001` dogiel type II neuron\n+- `CL_9900002` intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900003` interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900004` secretomotor/vasodilator neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900005` intestinofugal neuron\n+- `CL_9900006` ascending interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900007` descending interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900008` stubby Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900009` spiny Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900010` dogiel type II neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900011` calretinin-positive intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900012` calretinin-negative intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900013` cholinergic neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900014` nitrergic neuron of myenteric plexus\n+\n+## Rationale And Modeling Notes\n+\n+- Added definitions and synonym xrefs from the PMIDs supplied in the issue.\n+- Added `term_tracker_item` annotations via `IAO_0000233` pointing to issue #3584.\n+- Added `terms:date` timestamps and `terms:creator \"GitHub Copilot\"` for all new terms.\n+- Used `RO_0002100` for myenteric plexus soma location, matching existing CL location patterns.\n+- Used logical definitions only where they were safe and consistent, such as myenteric sensory/interneuron groupings and cholinergic/nitrergic grouping classes.\n+- Did not make `interneuron of myenteric plexus` a subclass of `CL:0000099` because that existing class is constrained to the CNS (`part_of some UBERON:0001017`), which made the enteric/myenteric terms unsatisfiable under ELK. The new term is instead modeled under `enteric neuron` with myenteric soma location.\n+- Added an axon target restriction for intestinofugal neuron using a union of the listed prevertebral sympathetic ganglia targets.\n+- Did not add calretinin protein-expression logical axioms because the issue explicitly flagged this as needing a PRO term lookup/import decision.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- Checked that requested labels were not already present in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Checked requested parent terms and existing myenteric soma location patterns.\n+- Attempted to fetch cited full texts with `aurelian fulltext`, but `aurelian` was not installed in this environment.\n+- Validated syntax with `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-check.owl`.\n+- Validated satisfiability with `robot reason -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --reasoner ELK -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-reasoned.owl`.\n+- Checked whitespace with `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Note: I added the requested myenteric neuron terms and validated the ontology with ROBOT convert and ELK reasoning.\n","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"PR_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@\n+## Summary\n+\n+Added 14 new CL terms for myenteric neuron types requested in issue #3584, using new `CL_99xxxxx` identifiers:\n+\n+- `CL_9900001` dogiel type II neuron\n+- `CL_9900002` intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900003` interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900004` secretomotor/vasodilator neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900005` intestinofugal neuron\n+- `CL_9900006` ascending interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900007` descending interneuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900008` stubby Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900009` spiny Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900010` dogiel type II neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900011` calretinin-positive intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900012` calretinin-negative intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900013` cholinergic neuron of myenteric plexus\n+- `CL_9900014` nitrergic neuron of myenteric plexus\n+\n+## Rationale And Modeling Notes\n+\n+- Added definitions and synonym xrefs from the PMIDs supplied in the issue.\n+- Added `term_tracker_item` annotations via `IAO_0000233` pointing to issue #3584.\n+- Added `terms:date` timestamps and `terms:creator \"GitHub Copilot\"` for all new terms.\n+- Used `RO_0002100` for myenteric plexus soma location, matching existing CL location patterns.\n+- Used logical definitions only where they were safe and consistent, such as myenteric sensory/interneuron groupings and cholinergic/nitrergic grouping classes.\n+- Did not make `interneuron of myenteric plexus` a subclass of `CL:0000099` because that existing class is constrained to the CNS (`part_of some UBERON:0001017`), which made the enteric/myenteric terms unsatisfiable under ELK. The new term is instead modeled under `enteric neuron` with myenteric soma location.\n+- Added an axon target restriction for intestinofugal neuron using a union of the listed prevertebral sympathetic ganglia targets.\n+- Did not add calretinin protein-expression logical axioms because the issue explicitly flagged this as needing a PRO term lookup/import decision.\n+\n+## Checklist\n+\n+- Checked that requested labels were not already present in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+- Checked requested parent terms and existing myenteric soma location patterns.\n+- Attempted to fetch cited full texts with `aurelian fulltext`, but `aurelian` was not installed in this environment.\n+- Validated syntax with `robot convert -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-check.owl`.\n+- Validated satisfiability with `robot reason -i src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --reasoner ELK -o /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-reasoned.owl`.\n+- Checked whitespace with `git diff --check -- src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n","additions":40,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","time":{"start":1778977104941,"end":1778977104954}},"id":"prt_e334c2753001OxC1IRZ3jlTNIp","sessionID":"ses_1ccbc1452ffeszWjsWacrU366B","messageID":"msg_e334c1c62001Dq91i1yeD7FhHD"}}
